# Prow reads this file for both merge labels. `approvers` can set `approved`;
# `approvers` and `reviewers` can set `lgtm`, and Prow sets it for nobody else:
# the Prow configuration for this repository (prow/oss/plugins.yaml in
# GoogleCloudPlatform/oss-test-infra) lists it under skip_collaborators, so
# being a collaborator or an organisation member is not enough. Machine
# accounts are never listed here. Every change needs one person other than its
# author (docs/pull-request-workflow.md, "How a change merges").
